WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:15.538
"Huh?" said to Henry.

2
00:00:15.558 --> 00:00:17.160
"Where are we going?"

3
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.301
Henry just started running.

4
00:00:19.982 --> 00:00:21.803
Cole, Maggie, and Nathan followed.

5
00:00:27.028 --> 00:00:27.968
where are you going?"

6
00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:29.450
Nora appeared behind them.

7
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:32.092
"Nowhere," Nathan called.

8
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.400
"Go away."

9
00:00:34.361 --> 00:00:38.943
Nora ignored her brother's orders and chased after them as Henry led the way to the basket-weaving booth.

10
00:00:39.923 --> 00:00:44.825
They arrived just in time to see someone scurrying out, holding a large shopping bag.

11
00:00:44.845 --> 00:00:47.186
"Patrick!" Henry called.

12
00:00:47.886 --> 00:00:50.387
"Stop!" Patrick scowled.

13
00:00:50.407 --> 00:00:53.929
"What? I need to get back to the art show for the judging."

14
00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:57.250
"You're too late," Maggie informed him.

15
00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:00.131
"The judges already looked at your painting.

16
00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:01.792
Why weren't you there?"

17
00:01:02.832 --> 00:01:04.232
She still looked confused.

18
00:01:04.873 --> 00:01:06.053
So did Cole and Nathan.

19
00:01:06.973 --> 00:01:09.074
Nora wasn't paying attention to any of them.

20
00:01:10.054 --> 00:01:12.295
She was looking at some pretty baskets nearby.

21
00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.915
Henry stared at the shopping bag.

22
00:01:15.616 --> 00:01:17.816
"We heard you made a basket," he said.

23
00:01:17.836 --> 00:01:22.817
"It must be really large if you need that huge bag to carry it."

24
00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:24.738
"Yeah, so what?"

25
00:01:24.998 --> 00:01:26.298
Patrick glared at Henry.

26
00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:28.199
Henry smiled.

27
00:01:28.219 --> 00:01:29.659
"Can we see it?"

28
00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.020
Just then Hannah appeared.

29
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.961
"His basket isn't large," she said.

30
00:01:34.981 --> 00:01:38.602
"He made a little round basket, just like everyone else."

31
00:01:38.622 --> 00:01:40.843
"What are you doing here?"

32
00:01:41.124 --> 00:01:41.904
Maggie asked her.

33
00:01:41.924 --> 00:01:44.045
"I saw you guys run off."

34
00:01:44.285 --> 00:01:45.045
Hannah shrugged.

35
00:01:45.065 --> 00:01:47.666
"I was curious, so I followed you.

36
00:01:48.346 --> 00:01:49.127
What's going on?"

37
00:01:49.147 --> 00:01:54.389
"If Patrick made a small basket, why'd you put it in such a big bag?"

38
00:01:54.609 --> 00:01:55.729
Henry asked Hannah.

39
00:01:55.749 --> 00:01:58.791
"That's Patrick's bag," Hannah said.

40
00:01:58.811 --> 00:02:01.792
"He told me he'd put his basket in there.

41
00:02:02.528 --> 00:02:04.369
He said it had extra canvases in it."

42
00:02:04.389 --> 00:02:08.793
"If that's true, maybe you should show us," Henry told Patrick.

43
00:02:09.933 --> 00:02:11.114
Patrick looked stubborn.

44
00:02:11.134 --> 00:02:12.515
"Why should I?

45
00:02:13.296 --> 00:02:15.337
It's none of your business what I have in my bag."

46
00:02:16.418 --> 00:02:17.679
Maggie stepped forward.

47
00:02:17.699 --> 00:02:20.041
"You'd better show us what's in your bag!

48
00:02:21.081 --> 00:02:24.844
And if there's a painting of a cat in there, you're going to be in big trouble!"

49
00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:26.705
Nora rushed over.

50
00:02:26.725 --> 00:02:29.067
"A painting of a cat?"

51
00:02:29.387 --> 00:02:29.928
she cried.

52
00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.761
"No! That's mine!"

53
00:02:34.422 --> 00:02:36.643
She grabbed the shopping bag out of Patrick's hand.

54
00:02:36.663 --> 00:02:39.004
"Hey!" Patrick cried.

55
00:02:39.804 --> 00:02:42.065
But Nora was already dumping out the contents.

56
00:02:43.126 --> 00:02:46.907
A tiny basket tumbled onto the ground—followed by Nathan's painting!

57
00:02:46.927 --> 00:02:49.668
"Aha!" Cole cried.

58
00:02:49.688 --> 00:02:50.749
"But wait.

59
00:02:51.289 --> 00:02:52.830
I thought Patrick had an alibi."

60
00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.031
"Me too," said Henry.

61
00:02:55.051 --> 00:03:00.717
"Then I realized something: Hannah told us that Patrick was in her booth.

62
00:03:01.718 --> 00:03:04.780
But she didn't say exactly when he was there.

63
00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:10.643
And I remembered he had a big bag, but probably made a tiny basket."

64
00:03:11.264 --> 00:03:11.804
He shrugged.

65
00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:16.186
"Besides, Patrick was the one with the best motive all along."

66
00:03:18.108 --> 00:03:19.628
Patrick's eyes looked watery.

67
00:03:19.649 --> 00:03:22.270
"I'm sorry, Nathan," he blurted out.

68
00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:25.372
"I really wanted my painting to be in the museum.

69
00:03:26.088 --> 00:03:29.051
When Owen told us how much the judges liked yours, I panicked."

70
00:03:30.412 --> 00:03:32.293
Patrick's parents were standing nearby.

71
00:03:32.313 --> 00:03:34.915
"Patrick!" his mother cried.

72
00:03:34.935 --> 00:03:37.778
"I cannot believe what I am hearing!"

73
00:03:38.738 --> 00:03:40.520
Patrick slunk over to his parents.

74
00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:44.703
While they scolded him harshly, Cole grabbed the painting.

75
00:03:44.723 --> 00:03:47.786
"We need to get this back before it's too late!"

76
00:03:51.869 --> 00:03:55.312
But when the kids arrived back at the art show, the judges were finished.

77
00:03:56.492 --> 00:03:57.853
"Wait!" Maggie cried.

78
00:03:57.873 --> 00:03:59.875
"We have one more painting."

79
00:03:59.895 --> 00:04:02.877
"I'm sorry, young lady," the art teacher said.

80
00:04:02.897 --> 00:04:04.758
"I'm afraid it's too late.

81
00:04:05.379 --> 00:04:06.600
We've already chosen the winners."

82
00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.302
"But it's not Nathan's fault his painting wasn't here!"

83
00:04:10.563 --> 00:04:11.583
Cole protested.

84
00:04:12.544 --> 00:04:13.885
The curator shook her head.

85
00:04:13.905 --> 00:04:15.486
"I'm sorry.

86
00:04:15.586 --> 00:04:19.389
We can't—" Suddenly Daniella stepped out of the crowd.

87
00:04:19.409 --> 00:04:24.268
"Perhaps I can change your minds?"

88
00:04:24.288 --> 00:04:26.970
She whipped off her red wig, revealing dark hair beneath.

89
00:04:27.791 --> 00:04:29.232
The judges all gasped.

90
00:04:29.252 --> 00:04:30.773
"Can it be?"

91
00:04:31.073 --> 00:04:32.394
the art teacher exclaimed.

92
00:04:32.414 --> 00:04:35.616
"It's Daniella Diaz!"

93
00:04:36.096 --> 00:04:37.397
the local painter cried.

94
00:04:38.358 --> 00:04:39.719
The curator looked awed.

95
00:04:39.739 --> 00:04:42.240
"I'd recognize her anywhere."

96
00:04:43.341 --> 00:04:44.662
Henry glanced at his friends.

97
00:04:45.342 --> 00:04:46.403
They looked surprised.

98
00:04:46.423 --> 00:04:50.566
"I guess she really is world famous," Cole whispered.

99
00:04:50.586 --> 00:04:53.548
"Please, dear art lovers."

100
00:04:54.368 --> 00:04:57.009
Daniella took Nathan's painting out of Cole's hands.

101
00:04:57.029 --> 00:05:02.291
"Could you include my young friend's painting in your little contest?

102
00:05:03.292 --> 00:05:05.473
I'd consider it a personal favor."

103
00:05:05.493 --> 00:05:07.153
"Of course!"

104
00:05:07.453 --> 00:05:08.914
the local painter exclaimed.

105
00:05:08.934 --> 00:05:11.235
"We'll take a look right now."

106
00:05:13.276 --> 00:05:14.856
The curator peered at the painting.

107
00:05:14.877 --> 00:05:17.818
"Oh, I remember this one," she said.

108
00:05:17.838 --> 00:05:20.319
"It was one of my favorites."

109
00:05:21.519 --> 00:05:23.080
Henry stepped over to Daniella.

110
00:05:23.704 --> 00:05:25.945
"Thanks for helping my friend," he told her.

111
00:05:25.965 --> 00:05:29.105
"Even though you didn't want to be recognized."

112
00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:31.106
Daniella winked.

113
00:05:31.946 --> 00:05:34.067
"Anything for art, my boy."

114
00:05:43.249 --> 00:05:46.310
Henry said later as the curator hung up Nathan's painting.

115
00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.191
"It looks great!"

116
00:05:49.211 --> 00:05:50.371
Nathan looked stunned.

117
00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:53.312
"I can't believe my painting is in the museum!"

118
00:05:54.408 --> 00:05:55.849
Nora stared up at the painting.

119
00:05:55.869 --> 00:05:59.332
"Hi, Patches," she said sadly.

120
00:05:59.352 --> 00:06:00.993
"Don't worry."

121
00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:02.855
Nathan put an arm around her.

122
00:06:02.875 --> 00:06:06.358
"The painting is yours, just like I promised.

123
00:06:07.278 --> 00:06:09.740
The museum is just borrowing it for a year, okay?"

124
00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.963
"Mine! Hooray!"

125
00:06:13.303 --> 00:06:14.124
Nora cheered.

126
00:06:15.205 --> 00:06:16.106
Nathan laughed.

127
00:06:16.126 --> 00:06:19.348
"And hooray for The Lemonade Detectives!"

128
00:06:19.688 --> 00:06:20.189
he added.

129
00:06:20.209 --> 00:06:22.130
"They always solve the
